## User

Look up every key of a list in an association list, keeping only the values that are found.

## Context

```haskell
lookup :: Eq a => a -> [(a, b)] -> Maybe b
```

## Type

type
```haskell
lookupAll :: Eq k => [k] -> [(k, v)] -> [v]
```

## Term

```haskell
lookupAll [] _ = []
lookupAll ((k, v) : xs) kvs =
  case lookup k kvs of
    Just v -> v : lookupAll xs kvs
    Nothing -> lookupAll xs kvs
```

